      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.92 (vs ₹1.32 loss in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.92 (up from ₹1.32 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹478.1m (down 4.7% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹22.0m (up ₹31.8m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 4.6% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 45% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 17% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
